&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Identify and recruit new potential partners in assigned territory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Leverage personal network and prospecting skills to engage new partners and build on Canonical’s already-successful relationships&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
