&lt;li&gt;Support marketing team members with setting up and monitoring paid ads campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor paid ads performance and budgets across the Marketing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build on automation and AI to improve paid ads performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop Canonical&#39;s adtech stack to industry leading standard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
