&lt;li&gt;Willingness to examine the status quo and be resilient in the face of challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ambition to build tomorrow&#39;s AI/Data stack in open source.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An exceptional academic track record from high school and university.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business level written and spoken English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sincere personal motivation aligned with our mission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International travel 2-4 times a year for company events up to two weeks long.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition we expect that you will match our values, by being:&lt;/p&gt;
