&lt;li&gt;Organize and lead the team’s processes in order to help it achieve its objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct one-on-one meetings with team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and measure team health indicators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interact with a vibrant community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review code produced by other engineers&lt;/li&gt;
