&lt;li&gt;Hands-on knowledge of social media management and analytics tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in mentorship and team development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An analytical eye and the ability to develop measuring frameworks to inform senior decision making&lt;/li&gt;
