&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coaching leaders to visibly raise their game against a clear standard of management excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Landing the hard conversations, because you coach leaders to make them happen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turning 360 feedback into real, followed-through commitments, not a report that gets filed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Lifting organisations and the company&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leaving an organisation you take on visibly&amp;nbsp; better led, off a sharp first-weeks diagnosis and a plan you own and drive.&lt;/li&gt;
