&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Building the function and its standards&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing the practitioners in the field so they get visibly better at their craft under your supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Setting the bar for how coaching and organisational development is done at Canonical: owning what exceptional looks like, proving the methods in the field, and holding the practice to them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharpening the management-excellence standard itself across Canonical, by feeding back what you learn in the field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for in you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
