&lt;li&gt;Delivering metrics and reporting to monitor and improve revenue operations effectiveness, including new leads, pipeline, velocity, sales productivity and renewals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using data to drive insight, manage territories and channels, improve productivity, and agree and implement actionable change with executive management through regular sales and business reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overseeing our sales technology and processes, driving automation and process improvements and partnering with our commercial systems engineering team to continuously improve business systems and integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading the introduction of new products, pricing, packaging and bundling through systems that are easy for sales and partners to navigate and quote&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving data quality, through order processing, new hire training, process documentation, reporting and data cleansing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading and enhancing our commercial review process for evaluating and steering sales and alliance opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning the commission plan and leading the process for setting goals, evaluating and paying against that plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
