&lt;p&gt;Depending on your eventual team, you might also bring experience with&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Container technologies such as LXD, Docker and Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly concurrent, distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance engineering – from kernel to web – benchmarks, optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software security – fuzzing, tabletop threat models, analysis, audit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build systems and toolchains, including for cross-compilation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Public clouds or OpenStack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debian/Ubuntu packaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems programming or scalable web services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep quality and test engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Web or Flutter front-end experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;REST and gRPC API experience&lt;/li&gt;
