&lt;p&gt;Accelerate your technical career by joining Canonical in a high-impact, multi-disciplinary role.. You&#39;ll be working from our London office, which hosts our events, customer demos and visitors, in an event space with professional live video, audio and streaming equipment. You&#39;ll wear three hats: Linux and cloud support engineer, owner of the office&#39;s technical infrastructure, and one of the people running the live production at our events. You&#39;ll own your cases from first contact to resolution, bringing in colleagues or senior engineers when needed, and you&#39;ll keep the technology running when it matters most, with people watching. While professional broadcast or AV experience is not required, a strong technical curiosity for audio/video systems and the composure to manage live, high-stakes environments are a must.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: Office Based in London, England.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role entails&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
