&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of talent selection, with a technological mindset to create automation&#39;s and products to drive hiring efficiencies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced analytical ability to dissect and analyse data, using either SQL, Python and/or statistical analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
