&lt;li&gt;Lead the identification and resolution of complex kernel issues reported by partners, customers, or discovered through rigorous testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the delivery of distinct, silicon-optimized variants of the Ubuntu Linux kernel to the global community&lt;/li&gt;
