&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the technical vision and roadmap for Ubuntu&#39;s package management and system lifecycle platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in design reviews and key technical decisions affecting software management and system lifecycle technologies across the Ubuntu ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote high standards for performance, reliability, security, and maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and support a team of engineers responsible for key Ubuntu platform technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
